rmat","target":"由于以下技能，你无法遗忘该技能树：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3422c9d60aceedb0331341bf3cc60aef96c88882c52e99eee927fd9cdf6f246f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8aaef46e822b92c20d3fcfe42e4c9a79689d4a5344bfbdb8901a54c6ba107427","logical_entry_identity":"f0411a7a5ea07e6a381edc1990c4d27be9d365e93eb81fbdacc231d115755264","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This scalpel was used by the dread sorcerer Kor'Pul when he began learning the necromantic arts in the Age of Dusk.  Many were the bodies, living and dead, that became unwilling victims of his terrible experiments.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这把解剖刀曾经被可怕的巫师卡·普尔在黄昏纪刚开始学习死灵法术时使用。无论活物还是死尸，许多都成了他可怕实验中不情愿的牺牲品。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"da64ea8723307a8ca68d98788095dbb4d3cc864ecf9361d1eabd261ba1fddb0a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8aaef6ec310db486d3beec61cb9c22196d0844123b0c170ac2567e4aac811ab9","logical_entry_identity":"6dfbc539074216f199c6adf6cad3f30cb4ed0b00577615f75d94cabb03505e60","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"nightmare","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"梦魇"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"14b1f3965665caf00ae43d23b2104aa60eb4aa581cf85d4ad4e09394fa5f043e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8ab4cc09f900206e00c0ba2044a0057d45c0043730d51b02863696127b9de266","logical_entry_identity":"2f3b138ff66b7876cb5c871ef6c741620c429378b7c60b8ba327722a551733b9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou died ages ago, but that did not stop you. You were raised as an undead skeleton.\n\nYour Necromancer master has plans for you, but something is wrong: you seem to have kept your free will.\nGet rid of this evil mage and try to find a place in the world.\n\nYou have been raised in a place called the Blighted Scar, on the northern border of the Shaloren lands. Escape this forsaken pit and try your luck in old forgotten places.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎你 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#！\n你早已死去，但死亡没能阻止你。你被唤醒为一个亡灵骷髅。\n\n你的死灵法师主人对你另有安排，但出了点问题：你似乎保留了自由意志。\n摆脱这个邪恶法师，努力在世界上找到自己的容身之处。\n\n你在永恒精灵领地北部边境一处名为荒芜之痕的地方被唤醒。逃离这个被遗弃的深坑，到那些遭人遗忘的古老之地碰碰运气。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ed66d4e482946c5dec4eb3ba27f46f5a831e9d9f3b6dec01042b39a9459c4488","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8ab4f205af413c86a3908187a9fc4fd1d1fdd56e6827c8755b540fb0a75d3792","logical_entry_identity":"d4a8f63311de67e6d841d595f62f217addbbb748ac7b292dad73572a572e063b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"[Relate to him the story of the staff and the Orb of Many Ways and the portals.]","source_tag":"_t","target":"[告诉他关于法杖、多元水晶球和传送门的事。]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9cffd61296708d62e27aca2338b963ba9b70d0c1bf0307caebcc1719b54c462c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8ab59ead2b56f50be81347f0d896d76ecf9ba5b61d45a0c5ce44d284c7d6a464","logical_entry_identity":"059e9897dfb7aae2bdf643b6dd100e8316ed3d8e9373f0058c140296cd854c42","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD##{bold}#Flagpost tactical bars#WHITE##{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD##{bold}#战术视图旗杆#WHITE##{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bc2bbb5b7ea56357f114760f684a0f6939765b28ea9025ed87da404b77358387","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8ab9a12696ab7ee7a062e7dbf75dbae5a95299d3277ae341c28c89d685dfad43","logical_entry_identity":"7638672feffee0f638296adec89f363ba10873bd78f804481f46e228bf9f420c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Curse of Nightmares","source_tag":"_t","target":"噩梦诅咒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e49d17c761aba17daec9311bec4a88257e92df0cbffed286799bb9f23fe72b93","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8abd7753a0df783fcb4818f1e5d5b2ac216e64908479883056217edd05b65fce","logical_entry_identity":"c8554ef14e0079768851dd32ca090ecded5327d8a11e3a2e44cc804020c83885","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Target is protected by a mirror image. Increases damage dealt to blind or dazzled creatures by %d%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被镜像保护。增加对致盲和炫目敌人伤害%d%%